    {
      "feature": "Layer independence: a decision listing ONLY withdrawnChecklistItemRefs withdraws only the checklist item (binding stays active), and a decision listing ONLY withdrawnAcceptanceBindingRefs withdraws only the binding (checklist item stays unchanged) -- no silent cross-cancellation between the two layers",
