    {
      "feature": "Negative smoke: done still means delivered; withdrawn is excluded from delivered/completed counts; withdrawn without a valid decisionRef is refused; a decision not citing the item is refused; mismatched decision ids across the two layers are refused; the original binding survives withdrawal unmodified; withdrawing all core bindings does not yield a pass",
      "covered_by": "CHK-007",
