    {
      "feature": "scope_shrinkage_decision_set is the pre-existing authorized post-DEV shrinkage writer (allowedPhases PLAN/DEV/REVIEW/TEST); an unconfirmed (userConfirmed != true) decision must be treated as unresolved by any consumer, including the new withdrawal mechanism",
      "covered_by": "CHK-005",
